  "rootAssessment": "Substantive assent to the exact reviewed D1a r4 (M3-D r5 items 1 to 8, macOS; D1a plan r2): the closed launch classes and protocol constructors (BBC and DRJ2 argv and environment, built from empty, with the always-refused keys), VerifiedLaunch, posix_spawn by path with SETSID, CLOEXEC_DEFAULT, SETSIGDEF and SETSIGMASK, moved child pipe ends and F_SETNOSIGPIPE, dlsym addchdir with the _np fallback, RLIMIT_CORE 0, the kqueue exit source, WNOWAIT, the EINTR-retried exact reap and the reap-last rule, proc_listpids group membership, and the scratch root: staged creation locked before exclusive publication, a sweep that proves death only by a lock it takes and re-verifies, and custody held by every child and kept for any child not exactly reaped (Drop and SetupAbandoned alike). Platform suite serial 0=0 with 24 new tests; eighteen mutations caught. Two new paths (inventory successor to follow); no caller (D3, D4); no Linux claim.",
